  "description": "<p>Update Fedora to use the latest version of Mulgara, currently 2.1.8.</p>\n\n<p>Significant fixes over version 2.1.4 (current version) include - the TQL endpoint now works correctly, in 2.1.4 this generated invalid XML in some circumstances, particularly subqueries; improved optimisation of queries that use UNION, which could impact \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-652\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-652\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Restructure resource index as a set of named graphs\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-652\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n and \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-651\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-651\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Investigate triple store support for restructuring resource index as a set of named graphs\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-651\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n</p>",
